      "message": "[warning] Line 877: 🟡 **Repository-tip discovery may not initialize for already-connected links.** `onRepositoryTip()` only stores callbacks; it does not backfill/mark existing channels for offers. If this hook is registered after links are up, those links may never receive an initial `have` until reconnect or another path touches `repositoryLinks_`. Consider seeding current links into `repositoryLinks_` and scheduling offers when enabling repository-tip handling.",
